{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space colonization takes a lot of work and is super dangerous. Far too dangerous for humans, so monkeys will have to do it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonkies </strong>is a space-monkey simulator where you experience life as a crew of bionic monkeys building the future of humanity among the stars, paid by the hour in bananas. Build moon habitats, rockets and floating space hotels - heck why not a nuclear reactor or two on a lake of frozen methane? Anything is possible when you strap a jetpack on a monkey, equip it with an industrial strength robot arm and wave goodbye to labor rights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please enjoy our short, but informational training video below!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hello there! Here you are! And here are your friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/8eb92320d5c486145832b3d332cadd0f.poster.avif?t=1764080420\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/8eb92320d5c486145832b3d332cadd0f.webm?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/8eb92320d5c486145832b3d332cadd0f.mp4?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is to pick up these blocks and stack them within the blue outline.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/83604f63064057f8008a6acec57df745.poster.avif?t=1764080420\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/83604f63064057f8008a6acec57df745.webm?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/83604f63064057f8008a6acec57df745.mp4?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sometimes you'll need to use other, less conventional types of blocks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/05e095ab88d721f5853f198637628f58.poster.avif?t=1764080420\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/05e095ab88d721f5853f198637628f58.webm?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/05e095ab88d721f5853f198637628f58.mp4?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things might get tricky.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/9b2fb84acf7dd83708e271a932f9129c.poster.avif?t=1764080420\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/9b2fb84acf7dd83708e271a932f9129c.webm?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/9b2fb84acf7dd83708e271a932f9129c.mp4?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But you\u2019ve got this! Have fun!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/03c59d3d8881e49c74d354177366c1dd.poster.avif?t=1764080420\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/03c59d3d8881e49c74d354177366c1dd.webm?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/03c59d3d8881e49c74d354177366c1dd.mp4?t=1764080420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build intricate</strong> (read: crazy dangerous) structures that just need to pass the 3-second inspection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hired by <strong>megalomaniacal space moguls</strong> (Yes, there are more than one) who will flush you out the airlock as soon as you mention unionization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize <strong>special building blocks</strong> and tools, some more nuclear than others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build on <strong>various surfaces</strong>: Good old martian soil, islands floating in water, islands floating in lava(!) and in zero gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the solar system, from Earth all the way to Pluto, and beyond! (<strong>70 levels+</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a veritable Zoo of <strong>the cutest astronauts imaginable</strong> (yes, there is a cat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the developer times on each level to earn the coveted <strong>Golden Banana Bunch</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ace entire planets for <strong>special secret rewards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music track by <strong>Philip Dahlstr\u00f8m</strong> (His chill beats will surely calm your rising blood pressure)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are still economy seats available on the banana shaped rocket!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/extras/4311a15b9c2fdfb65ebbe79c32db5737.avif?t=1764080420\" width=584 height=142 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Company mascot!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/8e15b66c6c61bd0e73839a72ad38afa919bf6fac.jpg"},{"name":"Team of the month!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/daa1eab160ee3354eaadbf9902a7ff9011d450b4.jpg"},{"name":"Bye bye, Earth!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/17f67ae7fdc15f8af0c39ca9d9fc374253d34d6b.jpg"},{"name":"Moon Office open!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/0bfcd072280b61aa0070916595f06452290bbcc1.jpg"},{"name":"Mars future proofed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/36c06c4e2837ac374119f0940b9f6c9de0bdc1bb.jpg"},{"name":"Titan online!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/6c86db9ab5d44569845937fe7e5415ff2ab63cbe.jpg"},{"name":"Europa industrialized!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/796957aab69f06a8c863f0176c3bf76dd0bac60b.jpg"},{"name":"Bonkie learns to stack!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/f9be06998d60b31bd76fac6ba6a82248b9d1abb6.jpg"},{"name":"Earth aced!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/6ef37e1b850e0c508abd703715edfc3eaa6f0a80.jpg"},{"name":"Moon aced!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/889260/9716cf9ca9791aabb67a5d16539230c57f34c1d4.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/889260?t=1764080420","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764080420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/1280245e60f267a0e7560ab24bb92650f1cb96cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764080420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889260/1280245e60f267a0e7560ab24bb92650f1cb96cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764080420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1314220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space colonization takes a lot of work and is super dangerous. Far too dangerous for humans, so monkeys will have to do it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonkies </strong>is a space-monkey simulator where you experience life as a crew of bionic monkeys building the future of humanity among the stars, paid by the hour in bananas. Build moon habitats, rockets and floating space hotels - heck why not a nuclear reactor or two on a lake of frozen methane? Anything is possible when you strap a jetpack on a monkey, equip it with an industrial strength robot arm and wave goodbye to labor rights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pl